1
00:00:00,170 --> 00:00:02,225
Imagine a kingdom
where lying is legal,

2
00:00:02,245 --> 00:00:04,226
but silence is a
crime.

3
00:00:04,246 --> 00:00:05,726
Here,
a magistrate fines a

4
00:00:05,746 --> 00:00:07,505
man for saying
nothing.

5
00:00:07,525 --> 00:00:08,230
Absurd?

6
00:00:08,250 --> 00:00:09,530
Read the law.

7
00:00:09,796 --> 00:00:11,101
Two hundred years
ago,

8
00:00:11,121 --> 00:00:12,951
the city fell to a
plot that everyone

9
00:00:12,971 --> 00:00:15,594
noticed,
and nobody mentioned.

10
00:00:15,614 --> 00:00:17,057
So they outlawed
silence.

11
00:00:17,077 --> 00:00:18,519
A lie can be argued
with.

12
00:00:18,539 --> 00:00:20,173
Silence can't.

13
00:00:20,193 --> 00:00:21,860
Laws show what a
people fear.

14
00:00:21,880 --> 00:00:23,710
Every strange law is
a scar.

15
00:00:23,730 --> 00:00:25,192
Find the wound.

16
00:00:25,212 --> 00:00:27,296
Invent one law that
would make outsiders

17
00:00:27,316 --> 00:00:28,809
fear your kingdom.
